==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*100 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 933.33 seconds<sup>28,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns.
**1 [[Trolly Blogger]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Just use ranged units, like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], that outrange Ursamajor and some meatshields for a straightforward fight. But don't take too long as the Assassin Bear will cripple your team if you don't destroy the base in time, thus advancing the Ursamajors. If you fear taking this long, just save your Cat Cannon to take him out.

On higher crowns difficulties, [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] alleviates much of the pressure from the Ursamajors.

